  "notes": "Backlog game, picked from RAWG's most-added list for its year (docs/PLAN.md section 2 ordering). StrategyWiki has a stub page (completion stage 0); Walkthrough, Gameplay and Table of Contents are linked but no subpages exist. starfield.fandom.com answers the API, but its game page has only about 30 linked pages (starfield-game.fandom.com was also tried and returned 404). None of the 82 Steam achievements are hidden. The Va'ruun'kai achievements are grouped as one expansion chapter; its official name is not in the allowed sources, so the chapter is named after the place. Another group added later (Delta, Incursions, Into the VOID, Battle of the Unifier, action figures and others) sits in its own chapter; which update or add-on each comes from was not checked. Fandom lists a 2026 PlayStation 5 release; RAWG still gives 2023-09-06."
